{"data": {"KogMaw": {"allytips": ["Kog'Maw can outrange most champions with his Bio-Arcane Barrage ability.", "Use Void Ooze to set up a perfect Living Artillery.", "Make the most out of your Icathian Surprise."], "blurb": "Belched forth from a rotting Void incursion deep in the wastelands of Icathia, Kog'Maw is an inquisitive yet putrid creature with a caustic, gaping mouth. This particular Void-spawn needs to gnaw and drool on anything within reach to truly understand it...", "enemytips": ["Kog'Maw doesn't have a good escape ability, so he is especially prone to ganks.", "Run away from Kog'Maw after he dies!!!!", "The range on Living Artillery increases each rank.", "Bio-Arcane Barrage allows Kog'Maw to kill Baron Nashor extremely early. It can be valuable to ward Nashor when Kog'Maw completes his Blade of the Ruined King."], "id": "KogMaw", "image": {"full": "KogMaw.png", "group": "champion", "h": 48, "sprite": "champion2.png", "w": 48, "x": 336, "y": 0}, "info": {"attack": 8, "defense": 2, "difficulty": 6, "magic": 5}, "key": "96", "lore": "Belched forth from a rotting Void incursion deep in the wastelands of Icathia, Kog'Maw is an inquisitive yet putrid creature with a caustic, gaping mouth. This particular Void-spawn needs to gnaw and drool on anything within reach to truly understand it. Though not inherently evil, Kog'Maw's beguiling naiveté is dangerous, as it often precedes a feeding frenzy—not for sustenance, but to satisfy its unending curiosity.", "name": "Kog'Maw", "partype": "Mana", "passive": {"description": "4 seconds after dying, Kogmaw explodes, dealing true damage to surrounding enemies.", "image": {"full": "KogMaw_IcathianSurprise.png", "group": "passive", "h": 48, "sprite": "passive2.png", "w": 48, "x": 336, "y": 0}, "name": "Icathian Surprise"}, "recommended": [], "skins": [{"chromas": false, "id": "96000", "name": "default", "num": 0}, {"chromas": false, "id": "96001", "name": "Caterpillar Kog'Maw", "num": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "96002"